// Props catalogue for the Ninja Adventure pack (CC0, Pixel-boy & AAA).
// GENERATED by scratchpad/catalogue/props_work/build.py — every rectangle was measured with Pillow
// (alpha bounding boxes + edge-connectivity for fence pieces); coordinates are pixels on the original sheets.
//
// Source sheets used (copied verbatim to /public/game/props/):
//   /game/props/TilesetNature.png  <-  Backgrounds/Tilesets/TilesetNature.png
//   /game/props/TilesetHouse.png  <-  Backgrounds/Tilesets/TilesetHouse.png
//   /game/props/TilesetElement.png  <-  Backgrounds/Tilesets/TilesetElement.png
//   /game/props/TilesetVillageAbandoned.png  <-  Backgrounds/Tilesets/TilesetVillageAbandoned.png
//   /game/props/TilesetTowers.png  <-  Backgrounds/Tilesets/TilesetTowers.png
//   /game/props/tileset_camp.png  <-  Backgrounds/Tilesets/tileset_camp.png
//   /game/props/TilesetFloorDetail.png  <-  Backgrounds/Tilesets/TilesetFloorDetail.png
//   /game/props/TilesetReliefDetail.png  <-  Backgrounds/Tilesets/TilesetReliefDetail.png
//   /game/props/FlagRed16x16.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/Flag/FlagRed16x16.png
//   /game/props/FlagBlue16x16.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/Flag/FlagBlue16x16.png
//   /game/props/FlagGreen16x16.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/Flag/FlagGreen16x16.png
//   /game/props/FlagYellow16x16.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/Flag/FlagYellow16x16.png
//   /game/props/FlagWhite16x16.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/Flag/FlagWhite16x16.png
//   /game/props/FlagBlack16x16.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/Flag/FlagBlack16x16.png
//   /game/props/FlagBrown16x16.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/Flag/FlagBrown16x16.png
//   /game/props/FlagGray16x16.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/Flag/FlagGray16x16.png
//   /game/props/Plant/SpriteSheet16x16.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/Plant/SpriteSheet16x16.png
//   /game/props/MillPropeller_A_64x64.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/MillPropeller/MillPropeller_A_64x64.png
//   /game/props/MillPropeller_B_64x64.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/MillPropeller/MillPropeller_B_64x64.png
//   /game/props/Watermill_A_34x36.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/WaterMill/Watermill_A_34x36.png
//   /game/props/Watermill_B_34x36.png  <-  Backgrounds/Animated/WaterMill/Watermill_B_34x36.png
//   /game/props/Fire.png  <-  FX/Particle/Fire.png
//
// Deliberately skipped: TilesetHouse window/door/wall fragments (rows 3-4 cols 0-9, cols 25-28 rows 3-7),
// TilesetElement indoor furniture (shelves, beds, rugs, stairs), Towers cracked/ruined variants other than
// the orange pagoda, Nature gem blocks (rows 15-16), Backgrounds/Animated/Flower (a 20x8 single-colour
// petal particle, not a flower), Conveyor Belt / QuickSand / Waterfall / Water Ripples (terrain, not props).
//
// Conventions: footprint is in tiles from the sprite's bottom-left (ox/oy shift it right/up).
// `light` is in pixels from the sprite's bottom-left with y NEGATIVE = upwards (screen space).
// Fence sets (palisade / rail / stone / iron) share one naming scheme: H, V, CornerTL/TR/BL/BR, EndL/EndR,
// TeeU/TeeD/TeeL/TeeR (the T opens up/down/left/right), Cross, Post (isolated).
// Windmill: `siloWoodLarge` (48x96) + `windmillBlades*` (64x64, hub at 32,32) with the blades' top-left at
//   (-8, -104) from the silo's bottom-left, i.e. hub on the front face at (24, -72). Watermill: `waterWheel*`
//   is a free-standing 34x36 wheel to butt against a house wall over water.
// Campfire: `firePitStone` / `firePitRing` (unlit) or `firePitEmbers` (lit, has light) + `campfireFlame`
//   (12x12, 5 looping frames of FX/Particle/Fire.png) with its bottom-left at (10, -10) from the pit's bottom-left.
// Bridges are side-view plank decks the player walks ON, so they are non-solid and NOT overhead.
// House footprints = full width x wall rows (roof rows excluded, ySort hides actors behind them);
// `tentPavilionLarge` uses oy:1 so its entrance flap row (door tile 4,0) stays walkable.

